t.getElementById('mExplanationText').innerHTML = explanation;\n\n      // Populate Neighbor List\n      document.getElementById('mDegreeHeader').innerText = `Conexiones Directas (${node.degree})`;\n      const listEl = document.getElementById('mNeighborList');\n      listEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n      node.neighbors.forEach(nb => {\n        const item = document.createElement('div');\n        item.className = 'neighbor-item';\n        item.innerHTML = `<span>${nb.label}</span><span style=\"color:#00ffff; font-size:9px;\">${catNames[nb.cat].split(' ')[0]}</span>`;\n        item.onclick = (e) => {\n          e.stopPropagation();\n          openNodeModal(nb);\n        };\n        listEl.appendChild(item);\n      });\n\n      modal.style.display = 'block';\n    }\n\n    function closeNodeModal() {\n      selectedNode = null;\n      document.getElementById('nodeModal').style.display = 'none';\n    }\n\n    function focusSelectedNode() {\n      if (!selectedNode || !selectedNode.proj) return;\n      panX = -selectedNode.x * (zoom / 650);\n      panY = -selectedNode.y * (zoom / 650);\n    }\n\n    // --- 3D Projection Math ---\n    function project(x, y, z, w, h) {\n      const cosY = Math.cos(rotY), sinY = Math.sin(rotY);\n      const x1 = x * cosY + z * sinY;\n      const z1 = -x * sinY + z * cosY;\n\n      const cosX = Math.cos(rotX), sinX = Math.sin(rotX);\n      const y2 = y * cosX - z1 * sinX;\n      const z2 = y * sinX + z1 * cosX;\n\n      const cx = x1 + panX;\n      const cy = y2 + panY;\n\n      const dist = 650;\n      const scale = zoom / (z2 + dist);\n\n      return {\n        x: w / 2 + cx * scale,\n        y: h / 2 + cy * scale,\n        z: z2,\n        scale,\n        visible: (z2 + dist) > 10\n      };\n    }\n\n    // --- Render Loop ---\n    function render() {\n      animTime += 0.012;\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n\n      if (opts.autoRotate && !isMouseDown && !selectedNode) {\n        rotY += velY;\n      } else if (!isMouseDown) {\n        rotY += velY; rotX += velX;\n        velX *= 0.92; velY *= 0.92;\n      }\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = palette.bg;\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      // 1. Reference Sphere\n      if (opts.showSphere) {\n        const radius = 240;\n        const steps = 48;\n        ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n        for (let i = 1; i < 7; i++) {\n          const phi = (i / 7) * Math.PI;\n          const rLat = radius * Math.sin(phi);\n          const yLat = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n\n          ctx.strokeStyle = palette.sphere;\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          let first = true;\n          for (let j = 0; j <= steps; j++) {\n            const theta = (j / steps) * Math.PI * 2;\n            const px = rLat * Math.cos(theta);\n            const pz = rLat * Math.sin(theta);\n            const p = project(px, yLat, pz, w, h);\n            if (p.visible) {\n              if (first) { ctx.moveTo(p.x, p.y); first = false; }\n              else { ctx.lineTo(p.x, p.y); }\n            }\n          }\n          ctx.stroke();\n        }\n\n        [0, Math.PI / 2].forEach(angle => {\n          ctx.strokeStyle = palette.sphereEquator;\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          let first = true;\n          for (let j = 0; j <= steps; j++) {\n            const a = (j / steps) * Math.PI * 2;\n            const px = radius * Math.cos(a);\n            const py = angle === 0 ? 0 : radius * Math.sin(a);\n            const pz = angle === 0 ? radius * Math.sin(a) : 0;\n            const p = project(px, py, pz, w, h);\n            if (p.visible) {\n              if (first) { ctx.moveTo(p.x, p.y); first = false; }\n              else { ctx.lineTo(p.x, p.y); }\n            }\n          }\n          ctx.stroke();\n        });\n      }\n\n      // 2. Project Nodes\n      nodes.forEach((n, idx) => {\n        if (!n.active) return;\n\n        let rx = n.ox !== undefined ? n.ox : n.x;\n        let ry = n.oy !== undefined ? n.oy : n.y;\n        let rz = n.oz !== undefined ? n.oz : n.z;\n\n        if (opts.pulseMotion && !n.isRoot) {\n          const wave = Math.sin(animTime * 1.8 + idx * 0.3) * 2;\n          rx += (rx / 200) * wave;\n          ry += (ry / 200) * wave;\n          rz += (rz / 200) * wave;\n        }\n\n        if (n.currentSize !== undefined && n.targetSize !== undefined) {\n          n.currentSize += (n.targetSize - n.currentSize) * 0.15;\n        } else {\n          n.currentSize = n.targetSize || 2;\n        }\n\n        n.proj = project(rx, ry, rz, w, h);\n      });\n\n      // 3. Draw Edges\n      if (opts.showEdges) {\n        ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n        edges.forEach(e => {\n          if (!e.active) return;\n          const s = nodes[e.source];\n          const t = nodes[e.target];\n\n          if (!s || !t || !s.proj || !t.proj || !s.proj.visible || !t.proj.visible) return;\n\n          const isHov = hoveredNode && (e.source === hoveredNode.id || e.target === hoveredNode.id);\n          const isSel = selectedNode && (e.source === selectedNode.id || e.target === selectedNode.id);\n          const isSrch = searchedId !== null && (e.source === searchedId || e.target === searchedId);\n\n          if (isHov || isSel || isSrch) {\n            ctx.strokeStyle = palette.edgeActive;\n            ctx.lineWidth = 2.5;\n          } else {\n            ctx.strokeStyle = selectedNode ? 'rgba(80, 20, 35, 0.25)' : palette.edge;\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n          }\n\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.moveTo(s.proj.x, s.proj.y);\n          ctx.lineTo(t.proj.x, t.proj.y);\n          ctx.stroke();\n        });\n      }\n\n      // 4. Draw Nodes\n      const sorted = [...nodes].filter(n => n.active && n.proj).sort((a, b) => a.proj.z - b.proj.z);\n\n      sorted.forEach(n => {\n        if (!n.proj.visible) return;\n\n        const px = Math.round(n.proj.x);\n        const py = Math.round(n.proj.y);\n        const isHov = hoveredNode && hoveredNode.id === n.id;\n        const isSel = selectedNode && selectedNode.id === n.id;\n        const isSrch = searchedId === n.id;\n\n        if (selectedNode && !isSel && !selectedNode.neighbors.includes(n)) {\n          ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(60, 60, 60, 0.3)';\n        } else {\n          ctx.fillStyle = (isHov || isSel || isSrch) ? '#ffffff' : palette.catColors[n.cat];\n        }\n\n        let sz = Math.max(2, Math.round(n.currentSize));\n        if (isHov || isSel || isSrch) sz += 4;\n\n        ctx.fillRect(px - Math.floor(sz/2), py - Math.floor(sz/2), sz, sz);\n\n        if (isHov || isSel || isSrch) {\n          ctx.font = \"11px ui-monospace, monospace\";\n          ctx.fillStyle = \"#ffffff\";\n          ctx.fillText(`${n.label} (${n.degree} conex.)`, px + sz + 4, py + 3);\n        }\n      });\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(render);\n    }\n\n    // --- Interaction Handlers ---\n    canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e => {\n      isMouseDown = true;\n      mouseBtn = e.button;\n      lastX = e.clientX;\n      lastY = e.clientY;\n      clickStartX = e.clientX;\n      clickStartY = e.clientY;\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('mouseup', e => {\n      isMouseDown = false;\n      const dragDist = Math.hypot(e.clientX - clickStartX, e.clientY - clickStartY);\n\n      // If clicked without dragging, select node to open pop-up!\n      if (dragDist < 5 && mouseBtn === 0) {\n        if (hoveredNode) {\n          openNodeModal(hoveredNode);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {\n      if (isMouseDown) {\n        const dx = e.clientX - lastX;\n        const dy = e.clientY - lastY;\n        if (mouseBtn === 0) {\n          velY = dx * 0.003;\n          velX = dy * 0.003;\n          rotY += velY; rotX += velX;\n        } else if (mouseBtn === 2) {\n          panX += dx; panY += dy;\n        }\n        lastX = e.clientX; lastY = e.clientY;\n      } else {\n        const mx = e.clientX;\n        const my = e.clientY;\n\n        let closest = null;\n        let minDist = 12;\n\n        nodes.forEach(n => {\n          if (!n.active || !n.proj || !n.proj.visible) return;\n          const d = Math.hypot(n.proj.x - mx, n.proj.y - my);\n          if (d < minDist) {\n            minDist = d;\n            closest = n;\n          }\n        });\n\n        if (closest !== hoveredNode) {\n          hoveredNode = closest;\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    canvas.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => e.preventDefault());\n    canvas.addEventListener('wheel', e => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      zoom *= e.deltaY < 0 ? 1.08 : 0.92;\n      zoom = Math.max(120, Math.min(1800, zoom));\n    }, { passive: false });\n\n    // Init\n    buildTopology();\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Adds pop-up explanation modal when clicking any node in the 3D network. Details why the node has its specific active connections, lists neighbors, and allows camera focusing.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\aleja\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\d3de736b-bad3-4cd4-b3f7-8b59f3dfee52\\hyperbolic_3d_network.html","toolAction":"Writing node click pop-up modal update","toolSummary":"Update 3D hyperbolic graph visualizer with click pop-up explanation modal"}}]}
