{"step_index":31,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-04T23:20:53Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Dataset Size**\n\nI've got it - the user's emphasis on \"ALL\" and \"more than 180\" is key. I need to make sure I include every item in the dataset provided. I'm cross-referencing this requirement against the itemized lists.\n\n\n**Verifying Complete Inclusion**\n\nOkay, the calculation confirms it. I need to ensure every single one of the 180 taxa/nodes is represented. The explicit feedback on the truncated list of `SIGAU` entries was critical. I'm focusing now on building a completely comprehensive array in `hyperbolic_3d_network.html` that meticulously accounts for each item in the dataset. I'm going to carefully verify each entry, and cross-reference.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Populates all 180+ exact nodes from the Kennedy Socioecological Swarm Network V6 dataset (MIC 1-15, HERP/MAM/MIA 1-12, AVE 1-38, ABI 1-7, and SIGAU 1-108). Zero truncation. Every single taxon is instantiated with 3D hyperbolic positioning and click pop-up data.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Sistema Socioecológico de Kennedy - Red Completa V6 (180+ Taxones)</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body, html {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background-color: #000000;\n      color: #f1f5f9;\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    #viewport {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      display: block;\n      cursor: crosshair;\n    }\n\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.88);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n    }\n\n    .top-bar {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 14px;\n      left: 14px;\n      right: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .bar-group {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n    }\n\n    .brand-title {\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .flat-btn {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 7px;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .flat-btn:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .flat-btn.active {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .side-drawer {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 66px;\n      left: 14px;\n      width: 320px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 14px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 90;\n      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .side-drawer.collapsed {\n      opacity: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      transform: translateX(-12px);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-title {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .cat-item {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s ease;\n    }\n    .cat-item:hover {\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n    }\n\n    .cat-label-wrap {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .flat-square-icon {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .cat-name {\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #f8fafc;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .cat-sub {\n      font-size: 9px;\n      color: #64748b;\n    }\n\n    .flat-badge {\n      font-size: 9px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .flat-toggle {\n      width: 16px;\n      height: 16px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .flat-toggle.checked {\n      background: #00ffff;\n      border-color: #00ffff;\n    }\n    .flat-toggle.checked::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: #000000;\n    }\n\n    .node-modal {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 66px;\n      right: 14px;\n      width: 360px;\n      max-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      padding: 16px;\n      pointer-events: auto;\n      z-index: 150;\n      border-left: 4px solid #00ffff;\n      animation: popIn 0.2s ease-out;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes popIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n\n    .modal-header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .modal-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .modal-sciname {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-style: italic;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n    }\n\n    .modal-close {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .modal-close:hover {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .node-img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 140px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      background: #000;\n    }\n\n    .modal-section {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .sec-label {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #64748b;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .info-box {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      color: #cbd5e1;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .info-box.alert-box {\n      background: rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.08);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.3);\n      color: #ff80a0;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-list {\n      max-height: 130px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .neighbor-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 5px 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .neighbor-item:hover {\n      background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-status {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 14px;\n      left: 14px;\n      right: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .status-pill {\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n    }\n    .status-pill b {\n      color: #00ffff;\n    }\n\n    .search-input {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #00ffff;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      outline: none;\n      width: 180px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Bar -->\n  <div class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"bar-group\">\n      <div class=\"glass-panel brand-title\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00ffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 9L19 5M12 15L5 19\"></path></svg>\n        SISTEMA KENNEDY V6 (180+ NODOS)\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn active\" id=\"btnToggleSide\" onclick=\"toggleSideDrawer()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\"></rect></svg>\n        <span>Filtro de Capas Bióticas</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Buscar taxón / especie...\" oninput=\"searchNode(this.value)\" class=\"glass-panel search-input\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bar-group\">\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn active\" id=\"btnAutoRot\" onclick=\"opts.autoRotate = !opts.autoRotate; this.classList.toggle('active')\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21.5 2v6h-6M21.34 15.57a10 10 0 1 1-.57-8.38l5.67-5.67\"></path></svg>\n        Autorotación\n      </button>\n\n      <button class=\"glass-panel flat-btn\" onclick=\"resetCamera()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v8M8 12h8\"></path></svg>\n        Reset Vista\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <canvas id=\"viewport\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- Side Drawer -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel side-drawer\" id=\"sideDrawer\">\n    <div class=\"drawer-title\">\n      <span>Capas Socioecológicas Kennedy</span>\n      <span style=\"color:#00ffff; font-size:9px;\">RE-CALCULO EN VIVO</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(0)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#00ff88; border-color:#00ff88;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Flora & Arbolado SIGAU (108 Taxones)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Censo completo SIGAU / PMA</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat0\">108</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat0\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(1)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#00ffff; border-color:#00ffff;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Avifauna Evaluada (38 Taxones)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Aves EN, VU, Residentes & Migratorias</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat1\">38</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat1\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(2)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ff007f; border-color:#ff007f;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Microorganismos & Biota (15 Taxones)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Bacterias, Cianobacterias & Hongos</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat2\">15</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat2\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(3)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ffee33; border-color:#ffee33;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Herpetos, Mamíferos & MIA (12 Taxones)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Anfibios, Reptiles, Curí, Chironomidae</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat3\">12</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat3\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(4)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ff0033; border-color:#ff0033;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Factores Abióticos & Presiones (7 Taxones)</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">Ruido >75dB, NDBI, Lixiviados, NO2</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat4\">7</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat4\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cat-item\" onclick=\"toggleCat(5)\">\n      <div class=\"cat-label-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"flat-square-icon\" style=\"background:#ffaa00; border-color:#ffaa00;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"cat-name\">Centro Integrador Kennedy</div>\n          <div class=\"cat-sub\">El Burro, La Vaca, Techo</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;\">\n        <span class=\"flat-badge\" id=\"badgeCat5\">1</span>\n        <div class=\"flat-toggle checked\" id=\"toggleCat5\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Pop-Up Modal -->\n  <div class=\"glass-panel node-modal\" id=\"nodeModal\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-header\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"modal-title\" id=\"mNodeTitle\">Tingua bogotana</div>\n        <div class=\"modal-sciname\" id=\"mNodeSciName\">Rallus semiplumbeus</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-close\" onclick=\"closeNodeModal()\">×</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <img id=\"mNodeImg\" src=\"\" alt=\"Fotografía / Taxón\" class=\"node-img\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\">\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\">Rol Ecológico / Función en Kennedy</div>\n      <div class=\"info-box\" id=\"mRoleBox\">Consumidor secundario...</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\">Ubicación / Hábitat en Kennedy</div>\n      <div class=\"info-box\" id=\"mLocBox\">Humedal El Burro y La Vaca...</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\">Sensibilidad / Alerta Socioecológica</div>\n      <div class=\"info-box alert-box\" id=\"mAlertBox\">Alta (>80% abandono por ruido >75dB)...</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"modal-section\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" id=\"mNeighborHeader\">Interacciones Bióticas Directas (0)</div>\n      <div class=\"neighbor-list\" id=\"mNeighborList\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:10px;\">\n      <button class=\"flat-btn\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center;\" onclick=\"focusSelectedNode()\">\n        <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>\n        Centrar Vista\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"flat-btn\" style=\"flex:1; justify-content:center; background:rgba(0,255,255,0.15); border-color:#00ffff; color:#00ffff;\" onclick=\"closeNodeModal()\">\n        Cerrar\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-status\">\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-pill\">\n      Taxones Visibles: <b id=\"lblActiveNodes\">0</b> | Interacciones Activas: <b id=\"lblActiveEdges\">0</b>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"glass-panel status-pill\">\n      181 Nodos Totales Cargados • Haz clic en cualquier nodo para ver la ficha completa\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const opts = {\n      autoRotate: true,\n      showSphere: true,\n      showEdges: true,\n      pulseMotion: true,\n      cats: { 0: true, 1: true, 2: true, 3: true, 4: true, 5: true }\n    };\n\n    const palette = {\n      bg: '#000000',\n      sphere: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22)',\n      sphereEquator: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)',\n      edge: 'rgba(160, 32, 64, 0.55)',\n      edgeActive: '#00ffff',\n      catColors: {\n        0: '#00ff88', // Flora: Green\n        1: '#00ffff', // Avifauna: Cyan\n        2: '#ff007f', // Microorganismos: Pink\n        3: '#ffee33', // Herpetos/MIA: Yellow\n        4: '#ff0033', // Abióticos: Crimson Red\n        5: '#ffaa00'  // Core: Gold\n      }\n    };\n\n    // --- PROGRAMMATIC COMPLETE DATASET GENERATOR (ALL 181 EXACT TAXA) ---\n    function buildFull180Dataset() {\n      const taxa = [];\n\n      // 1. CORE MASTER\n      taxa.push({ id: 'CORE-0', name: 'Sistema Socioecológico Kennedy', sciname: 'Humedales El Burro, La Vaca, Techo', cat: 5, role: 'Integración Total: Flora (108), Avifauna (38), Microorganismos (15), Herpetos & MIA (12), Factores Abióticos (7)', loc: 'Localidad de Kennedy (Bogotá)', alert: 'Red completa de enjambre V6 bajo presiones urbanas por ruido >75dB, concreto NDBI y lixiviados', img: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Wetland_water_reflection.jpg' });\n\n      // 2. MICROORGANISMOS (MIC-01 to MIC-15)\n      const micData = [\n        ['MIC-01', 'Nitrosomonas europaea', 'Oxidación de amonio a nitrito en biofiltro', 'Sedimento y biofiltro La Vaca / El Burro', 'Inhibido por metales pesados y lixiviados tóxicos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Nitrosomonas_europaea.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-02', 'Nitrobacter winogradskyi', 'Conversión de nitrito a nitrato (disponibilidad de N)', 'Agua y biofiltro hídrico', 'Sensible a anoxia severa y sulfuros', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Nitrobacter.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-03', 'Pseudomonas putida', 'Degradación de hidrocarburos y materia orgánica compleja', 'Agua residual urbana y sedimentos', 'Tolerante a estrés orgánico', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Pseudomonas_putida_01.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-04', 'Escherichia coli', 'Bioindicador de contaminación fecal por vertimientos', 'Cuerpos de agua El Burro y La Vaca', 'Aumenta con escorrentía sin tratar', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/EscherichiaColi_NIAID.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-05', 'Microcystis aeruginosa', 'Floración algal eutrófica, liberación de microcistinas', 'Espejo de agua estancada / El Burro', 'Estimulado por exceso de fósforo y nitrógeno', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Microcystis_aeruginosa.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-06', 'Anabaena flos-aquae', 'Fijación de nitrógeno atmosférico en florecimientos', 'Espejos hídricos eutrofizados', 'Respondedor a temperatura elevada (LST)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Anabaena_flosaquae.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-07', 'Rhizobium leguminosarum', 'Fijación simbiótica de N2 en leguminosas nativas', 'Rizósfera de Lupinus y arbustos nativos', 'Sensible a compactación del suelo', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rhizobium_leguminosarum.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-08', 'Trichoderma harzianum', 'Descomposición de hojarasca y protección radicular', 'Suelo orgánico bajo bosque melífero', 'Requiere humedad y materia orgánica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Trichoderma_harzianum.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-09', 'Gomphonema parvulum', 'Bioindicador de calidad hídrica y base trófica', 'Superficie de tallos de Typha y Schoenoplectus', 'Resistente a niveles moderados de polución', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gomphonema.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-10', 'Chlorella vulgaris', 'Producción de oxígeno disuelto y fijación de CO2', 'Columna de agua de los humedales', 'Sensible a herbicidas y sombra densa', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chlorella_vulgaris.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-11', 'Spirulina platensis', 'Producción primaria alta en agua alcalina', 'Remansos de agua con nutrientes', 'Indicador de carga orgánica alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Arthrospira_platensis.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-12', 'Methanosarcina barkeri', 'Producción de metano en sedimentos anóxicos', 'Fango bentónico profundo de La Vaca', 'Inhibida por oxigenación hídrica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Methanosarcina.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-13', 'Bacillus subtilis', 'Solubilización de fósforo y solubilidad de micronutrientes', 'Suelo de ronda en restauración', 'Alta resistencia por endosporas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Bacillus_subtilis.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-14', 'Glomus intraradices', 'Facilita absorción hídrica y de P en plantas de ronda', 'Raíces de Aliso, Capulí y Saúco', 'Destruido por labranza y compactación', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mycorrhiza_fungus.jpg'],\n        ['MIC-15', 'Agaricus campestris', 'Descomposición de materia orgánica vegetal en ronda', 'Praderas y humedales de borde', 'Sensible a plaguicidas urbanos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Agaricus_campestris.jpg']\n      ];\n      micData.forEach(m => taxa.push({ id: m[0], name: m[1], sciname: m[1], cat: 2, role: m[2], loc: m[3], alert: m[4], img: m[5] }));\n\n      // 3. HERPETOS, MAMÍFEROS & MIA (HERP 1-2, MAM 1-2, MIA 1-8)\n      const herpData = [\n        ['HERP-01', 'Rana sabanera', 'Dendropsophus labialis', 'Consumidor secundario / Bioindicador hídrico', 'Ronda hidráulica El Burro / La Vaca', 'Renacuajos comen algas; adultos consumen insectos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dendropsophus_labialis.jpg'],\n        ['HERP-02', 'Culebra sabanera', 'Atractus crassicaudatus', 'Depredador de suelo / Control de invertebrados', 'Pastizales de ronda ZMPA', 'Amenazada por gatos y corte de pasto', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Atractus_crassicaudatus.jpg'],\n        ['MAM-01', 'Chucurí / Comadreja', 'Mustela frenata', 'Depredador tope de ronda / Control de roedores', 'Matorrales densos El Burro y Techo', 'Requiere refugio en saucales', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Mustela_frenata.jpg'],\n        ['MAM-02', 'Curí silvestre', 'Cavia anolaimae', 'Herbívoro / Dispersor de semillas de pastos nativos', 'Praderas emergentes de borde', 'Depredación por perros sinantrópicos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cavia_porcellus_wild.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-01', 'Libélula sabanera', 'Aeshna intorta', 'Depredador acuático / Bioindicador de O2', 'Espejo hídrico bien oxigenado El Burro', 'Larvas comen dípteros; adultos cazan moscas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Aeshna_cyanea_01.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-02', 'Quironómido (Gusano rojo)', 'Chironomus sp.', 'Colector-recogedor / Bioindicador de eutrofización', 'Sedimento anóxico de La Vaca y El Burro', 'Base trófica principal para Tingua bogotana', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chironomus_plumosus.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-03', 'Caracol pliego', 'Physa acuta', 'Raspador de perifiton / Detritívoro', 'Tallo de junco (Schoenoplectus) y enea', 'Alimento para fochas, tinguas y garzas', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Physa_acuta.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-04', 'Camarón de agua dulce', 'Hyalella azteca', 'Fragmentador de hojarasca / Detritívoro bentónico', 'Bentos hídrico con hojarasca de Aliso', 'Alimento clave para patos acuáticos y renacuajos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hyalella_azteca.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-05', 'Sanguijuela de agua dulce', 'Helobdella stagnalis', 'Carroñero / Depredador de invertebrados', 'Limo orgánico denso en zonas de vertimiento', 'Indicador de alta carga orgánica particulada', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Helobdella_stagnalis.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-06', 'Chinche nadador', 'Buenoa sp.', 'Depredador de columna de agua', 'Espejo de agua abierto sin corriente', 'Controlador de larvas de mosquitos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Notonecta_glauca.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-07', 'Caballito de delgada cola', 'Ischnura ramburii', 'Depredador de perifiton y microartrópodos', 'Vegetación flotante (Azolla, Eichhornia)', 'Indicador de vegetación hídrica bien estructurada', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ischnura_ramburii.jpg'],\n        ['MIA-08', 'Gusano de fango', 'Tubifex tubifex', 'Detritívoro de fondo / Tolerante a anoxia', 'Sedimento contaminado con lixiviados', 'Indicador extremo de polución hídrica', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tubifex_tubifex.jpg']\n      ];\n      herpData.forEach(h => taxa.push({ id: h[0], name: h[1], sciname: h[2], cat: 3, role: h[3], loc: h[4], alert: h[5], img: h[6] }));\n\n      // 4. AVIFAUNA (AVE-01 to AVE-38)\n      const aveList = [\n        ['AVE-01', 'Tingua bogotana', 'Rallus semiplumbeus', 'En Peligro (EN) - Endémica', 'Humedal El Burro y La Vaca', 'Alta (>80% abandono por ruido >75dB)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Rallus_semiplumbeus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-02', 'Cucarachero de pantano', 'Cistothorus apolinari', 'En Peligro (EN) - Endémico', 'Humedal El Burro (Sector Norte)', 'Muy Alta (Inhibición de canto de cortejo)', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cistothorus_apolinari.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-03', 'Monjita cabeciamarilla', 'Chrysomus icterocephalus', 'Vulnerable (VU) - Subesp. Endémica', 'Humedal La Vaca y Techo', 'Alta sensibilidad a pérdida de Juncales', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Chrysomus_icterocephalus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-04', 'Pato andino', 'Oxyura ferruginea', 'Vulnerable (VU) / Malacófago', 'Espejo hídrico abierto El Burro', 'Sensible a contaminación con plásticos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Oxyura_jamaicensis_rubida.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-05', 'Tingua azul', 'Porphyrio martinica', 'Residente / Protegida', 'El Burro, La Vaca, Techo', 'Sensible a perros y gatos', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Porphyrio_martinicus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-06', 'Tingua gris / Polla de agua', 'Gallinula galeata', 'Residente abundante / Herbívora', 'El Burro y La Vaca', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Gallinula_galeata.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-07', 'Focha americana', 'Fulica americana', 'Residente acuática / Algas', 'Espejos de agua El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Fulica_americana.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-08', 'Pisingo', 'Dendrocygna autumnalis', 'Residente local / Granívoro', 'Pastizales de ronda El Burro', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Dendrocygna_autumnalis.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-09', 'Zambullidor piquigrueso', 'Podilymbus podiceps', 'Residente acuático / Piscívoro', 'Humedal El Burro', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Podilymbus_podiceps.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-10', 'Coquito', 'Phimosus infuscatus', 'Residente litoraleño / Invertebrados', 'Bordes fangosos La Vaca y Techo', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Phimosus_infuscatus.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-11', 'Garza real', 'Egretta thula', 'Residente / Depredadora en Sauce', 'Ronda hídrica El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Egretta_thula.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-12', 'Garza mayor', 'Ardea alba', 'Residente / Depredadora de dosel', 'Arbolado de ronda El Burro', 'Baja-Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Ardea_alba_01.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-13', 'Guaco / Garza nocturna', 'Nycticorax nycticorax', 'Residente nocturna / Ictiófaga', 'Sector protegido El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Nycticorax_nycticorax.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-14', 'Pato barraquete', 'Spatula discors', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Filtrador', 'Humedal El Burro (Invierno Norte)', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Spatula_discors.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-15', 'Andarríos solitario', 'Tringa solitaria', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Limoso', 'Ronda hídrica La Vaca', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Tringa_solitaria.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-16', 'Chié charquero / Anamú', 'Parkesia noveboracensis', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Insectívoro', 'Ecotono hídrico El Burro', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Parkesia_noveboracensis.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-17', 'Pibi oriental', 'Contopus virens', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Dosel', 'Corredor arbolado Av. Cali', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Contopus_virens.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-18', 'Atrapamoscas alisero', 'Empidonax alnorum', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Follaje', 'Bosque de Aliso y Saúco', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Empidonax_alnorum.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-19', 'Reinita canadiense', 'Cardellina canadensis', 'Migratorio / Amenazada', 'Saúco y Chilco de ronda', 'Alta', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cardellina_canadensis.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-20', 'Piranga roja', 'Piranga rubra', 'Migratorio Neotropical / Frugívoro', 'Capulí y saucales El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Piranga_rubra.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-21', 'Colibri chillón', 'Colibri coruscans', 'Residente / Polinizador de Saúco', 'Arbolado urbano y humedales', 'Baja', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Colibri_coruscans.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-22', 'Colibrí cometa', 'Lesbia nuna', 'Residente / Polinizador de Raque', 'Bosque de ronda El Burro', 'Media', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Lesbia_nuna.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-23', 'Mirla patinaranja', 'Turdus fuscater', 'Residente abundante / Hub Dispersor', 'Toda la localidad de Kennedy', 'Muy Baja', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Turdus_fuscater.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-24', 'Gorrión copetón', 'Zonotrichia capensis', 'Residente urbano / Granívoro', 'Arbolado nativo / Pastizales', 'Baja', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Zonotrichia_capensis.jpg'],\n        ['AVE-25', 'Cucarachero común', 'Troglodytes aed